            "botId": "bot-brody",
            "title": "The AI market map",
            "kind": "chat",
            "pinned": false,
            "unread": 0,
            "busy": false,
            "createdAt": "2026-11-10T05:53:14.602526-05:00",
            "updatedAt": "2026-11-11T06:23:14.602526-05:00",
            "messages": [
              {
                "id": "m-brody-1",
                "role": "user",
                "kind": "text",
                "text": "Rebuild my AI market map. Last time the sheet was stale, and I want sources and a confidence column this time.",
                "pending": false,
                "error": false,
                "createdAt": "2026-11-10T05:53:14.602526-05:00",
                "updatedAt": "2026-11-10T05:53:14.602526-05:00"
              },
              {
                "id": "m-brody-2",
                "role": "bot",
                "kind": "text",
                "text": "I rebuilt the list around the gap you flagged: the old sheet was six months stale and missed the entire agent wave.\n\n**What changed**\n- Added 24 companies, removed 9 that have been acquired or wound down.\n- Every row now carries source, last checked, and confidence.\n- The big gap is agents: Anthropic, OpenAI, Cursor, Cognition, and Sierra all moved.\n\n**Four things to know**\n- **Coordinates differ by source.** The original rows have exact HQ coordinates; new rows are city-level. There is a precision column so you can filter.\n- **Valuations are a cross-row trap.** They are as-of dates, not a snapshot. Do not sort by them.\n- **Private coverage is thin.** Wikipedia keeps public companies tidy and private ones messy. Confidence below 0.7 is flagged.\n- **Defunct companies are included on purpose.** They explain why a category looks less crowded than it really is.\n\nThe sheet is called **AI market map — Nov 2026**, with Companies, Summary, and Notes tabs. I would spend the next pass on the private agents list rather than refreshing public caps; that is where the decision is actually moving.",
                "pending": false,
                "error": false,
                "createdAt": "2026-11-11T06:23:14.602526-05:00",
                "updatedAt": "2026-11-11T06:23:14.602526-05:00"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
