            "id": "thread-gitscout-home",
            "botId": "bot-gitscout",
            "title": "Auth refactor review",
            "kind": "chat",
            "pinned": false,
            "unread": 1,
            "busy": false,
            "createdAt": "2026-11-11T00:53:14.602526-05:00",
            "updatedAt": "2026-11-11T02:53:14.602526-05:00",
            "messages": [
              {
                "id": "m-git-1",
                "role": "user",
                "kind": "text",
                "text": "Review the auth refactor on the open branch. I care more about the session edge cases than style.",
                "pending": false,
                "error": false,
                "createdAt": "2026-11-11T00:53:14.602526-05:00",
                "updatedAt": "2026-11-11T00:53:14.602526-05:00"
              },
              {
                "id": "m-git-2",
                "role": "bot",
                "kind": "text",
                "text": "Reviewed the diff and ran the suite. Nothing is on fire, but two session edge cases would bite in production:\n\n- **Refresh during a revoke race.** The refresh token is rotated before the old session is revoked. A concurrent retry can revive a session you just killed. Move the revoke into the same transaction as the rotation.\n- **Clock skew on the 5-minute grace window.** The window is computed with server time only; clients behind by more than a minute see a one-time 401. Prefer the token's iat with a small skew allowance.\n\nThe rest is solid. I would ship the transaction fix before the grace window; it is the one with a security consequence.",
                "pending": false,
                "error": false,
                "activities": [
                  {
                    "label": "Reading diff",
                    "detail": "14 files · +312 −188",
                    "status": "ok",
                    "startedAt": "2026-11-11T02:52:34.602526-05:00"
                  },
                  {
                    "label": "Running tests",
                    "detail": "auth · 48 passed",
                    "status": "ok",
                    "startedAt": "2026-11-11T02:52:54.602526-05:00"
                  }
                ],
                "createdAt": "2026-11-11T02:53:14.602526-05:00",
                "updatedAt": "2026-11-11T02:53:14.602526-05:00"
              }
            ]
          }
